5,1,1,talk,May,,This room is a mess because we have no rules. It's just a free-for-all and someone always ends up cleaning.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's not just the mess. The noise carries right into the office. It's distracting for those of us sitting nearby.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are all feeling the strain. I suspect we are wasting a lot of time and energy on inefficient habits.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know why we're still using it for everything! We need to see if we're spending money elsewhere too.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I feel like we've stopped actually talking to each other. We need a space that helps us connect properly.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, that's a good point. We should check how we're actually using the space and who is doing the work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need to look at the physical state of the room and the office desks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,I am interested in the time cost. How much are we walking or cleaning?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Exactly! Let's look at the invoices and the fit-out quotes. I want the hard numbers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,And we should look into where our conversations are actually happening. Or not happening.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the usage tally and the fridge history. Let's see who is actually in there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll take the partition wall and the crumbs at the desks. I need to prove the noise and mess.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look into the facilities callouts and the lunch round trip. Efficiency is key.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm sticking with the invoices and the quotes. We can't ignore the budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the unplanned talks and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
